msgstr "Gem Twitch-appen først."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:88
msgid "Twitch did not accept the login. Try again, and check the redirect URL of the Twitch app."
msgstr "Twitch godkendte ikke login. Prøv igen, og tjek Twitch-appens redirect-URL."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:90
msgid "The Kick app was saved. Kick accepted its credentials."
msgstr "Kick-appen er gemt. Kick godkendte dens credentials."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:91
msgid "The Kick app and every secret were removed."
msgstr "Kick-appen og alle hemmeligheder er fjernet."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:92
msgid "Kick did not accept the Client ID and Secret (or the bot name is invalid). Check them in the Kick developer settings."
msgstr "Kick godkendte ikke Client ID og Secret (eller bottens navn er ugyldigt). Tjek dem i Kicks udviklerindstillinger."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:93
msgid "Kick could not be reached. Try again later."
msgstr "Kick kunne ikke nås. Prøv igen senere."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:94
msgid "The Google app was saved. Log in with the bot account next."
msgstr "Google-appen er gemt. Log nu ind med bot-kontoen."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:95
msgid "The Google app, the YouTube bot and every secret were removed."
msgstr "Google-appen, YouTube-botten og alle hemmeligheder er fjernet."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:96
msgid "This is not a Google OAuth Client ID and Secret. Copy them from the Google Cloud console."
msgstr "Det er ikke et Client ID og Secret fra Google OAuth. Kopiér dem fra Google Cloud-konsollen."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:97
msgid "The YouTube bot was connected."
msgstr "YouTube-botten er forbundet."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:98
msgid "The YouTube bot was disconnected. No YouTube messages are sent until a bot is connected again."
msgstr "YouTube-botten er afbrudt. Der sendes ingen YouTube-beskeder, før en bot er forbundet igen."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:99
msgid "The login at Google was cancelled. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "Login hos Google blev afbrudt. Intet er ændret."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:100
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:318
msgid "Save the Google app first."
msgstr "Gem Google-appen først."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:101
msgid "Google gave no lasting access or the account has no YouTube channel. Log in again with the bot's YouTube channel and allow access."
msgstr "Google gav ikke varig adgang, eller kontoen har ingen YouTube-kanal. Log ind igen med bottens YouTube-kanal, og giv adgang."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:102
msgid "Google did not accept the login. Try again, and check the redirect URL and the YouTube Data API in the Google Cloud project."
msgstr "Google godkendte ikke login. Prøv igen, og tjek redirect-URL'en og YouTube Data API i Google Cloud-projektet."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:103
msgid "Google could not be reached. Try again later."
msgstr "Google kunne ikke nås. Prøv igen senere."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:105
msgid "Accept the privacy policy and terms of the YouTube chatbot first. They must be published (tab \"YouTube terms\")."
msgstr "Godkend først privatlivspolitikken og vilkårene for YouTube-chatbotten. De skal være offentliggjort (fanen \"YouTube-vilkår\")."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:106
msgid "The privacy policy and terms were accepted for the bot. YouTube messages are sent again."
msgstr "Privatlivspolitikken og vilkårene er godkendt for botten. YouTube-beskeder sendes igen."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:107
msgid "The texts were saved as a draft. Replace every placeholder to publish them."
msgstr "Teksterne er gemt som udkast. Erstat alle pladsholdere for at offentliggøre dem."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:108
msgid "The privacy policy and terms were published. Enter their URLs at Google, then accept them for the bot on the tab \"Chatbot\"."
msgstr "Privatlivspolitikken og vilkårene er offentliggjort. Indtast deres URL'er hos Google, og godkend dem derefter for botten på fanen \"Chatbot\"."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:109
msgid "A new version was published. Creators and the bot must accept it before YouTube messages are sent again."
msgstr "En ny version er offentliggjort. Creators og botten skal godkende den, før YouTube-beskeder sendes igen."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:110
msgid "The correction was saved; the version is unchanged."
msgstr "Rettelsen er gemt; versionen er uændret."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:111
msgid "Published texts cannot contain placeholders. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "Offentliggjorte tekster må ikke indeholde pladsholdere. Intet er gemt."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:112
msgid "Every text needs content. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "Alle tekster skal have indhold. Intet er gemt."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:114
msgid "The message format was saved."
msgstr "Beskedformatet er gemt."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:115
msgid "The chat subscriptions were renewed."
msgstr "Chat-abonnementerne er fornyet."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:116
msgid "The message was sent as the bot."
msgstr "Beskeden er sendt som botten."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:117
msgid "The platform did not send the message. Check that the bot is still in the channel."
msgstr "Platformen sendte ikke beskeden. Tjek, at botten stadig er i kanalen."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:118
msgid "YouTube did not let the bot write. Check that the livestream is not private and that the chat is not for subscribers or members only, and make the bot a moderator of the channel."
msgstr "YouTube tillod ikke botten at skrive. Tjek, at livestreamen ikke er privat, og at chatten ikke kun er for abonnenter eller medlemmer, og gør botten til moderator på kanalen."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:119
msgid "The creator is not live on YouTube right now. The bot can only write during a livestream."
msgstr "Creatoren er ikke live på YouTube lige nu. Botten kan kun skrive under en livestream."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:120
msgid "Google did not let the creator's account see its livestreams. The creator removes the bot and adds it again with the Google account that owns the channel (for a brand account: its owner), and checks that the channel may stream live. Google's error code is in WooCommerce → Status → Logs."
msgstr "Google lod ikke creatorens konto se sine livestreams. Creatoren fjerner botten og tilføjer den igen med den Google-konto, der ejer kanalen (for en brand-konto: dens ejer), og tjekker, at kanalen må livestreame. Googles fejlkode står under WooCommerce → Status → Logs."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:121
msgid "The day's YouTube quota is used up. Messages wait until it resets at midnight Pacific Time."
msgstr "Dagens YouTube-kvote er brugt op. Beskeder venter, til den nulstilles ved midnat Pacific Time."

