#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/YouTubeLegalTab.php:126
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Gem"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:279
msgid "YouTube bot"
msgstr "YouTube-bot"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:285
msgid "Publish the privacy policy and terms of the YouTube chatbot first (tab \"YouTube terms\"); Google requires them, and the bot account accepts them when it logs in."
msgstr "Offentliggør først privatlivspolitikken og vilkårene for YouTube-chatbotten (fanen \"YouTube-vilkår\"); Google kræver dem, og bot-kontoen godkender dem, når den logger ind."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:287
msgid "Log in with the Google account of the YouTube channel that writes the messages, not with your own. Google always asks which account to use."
msgstr "Log ind med Google-kontoen for den YouTube-kanal, der skriver beskederne, ikke med din egen. Google spørger altid, hvilken konto der skal bruges."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:291
msgid "Log in with the bot account at Google"
msgstr "Log ind med bot-kontoen hos Google"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:297
msgid "Google no longer accepts the bot's login (it was revoked, or the Google app is in testing, where logins expire after 7 days). Disconnect the bot and log in again."
msgstr "Google godkender ikke længere bottens login (det er tilbagekaldt, eller Google-appen er i test, hvor logins udløber efter 7 dage). Afbryd botten, og log ind igen."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:309
msgid "The privacy policy and terms of the YouTube chatbot have a new version. The bot sends no YouTube messages until you accept it for the bot."
msgstr "Privatlivspolitikken og vilkårene for YouTube-chatbotten har en ny version. Botten sender ingen YouTube-beskeder, før du godkender den for botten."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:314
msgid "Accept for the bot"
msgstr "Godkend for botten"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:324
msgid "Bot messages on YouTube"
msgstr "Bot-beskeder på YouTube"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:326
msgid "The Google app is saved."
msgstr "Google-appen er gemt."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:327
msgid "The privacy policy and terms are published and accepted for the bot."
msgstr "Privatlivspolitikken og vilkårene er offentliggjort og godkendt for botten."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:328
msgid "The bot's YouTube channel is logged in (youtube.force-ssl)."
msgstr "Bottens YouTube-kanal er logget ind (youtube.force-ssl)."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:329
msgid "Each creator adds the bot to the own channel (youtube.readonly) in the dashboard, so the livestream can be found."
msgstr "Hver creator tilføjer botten til sin egen kanal (youtube.readonly) i dashboardet, så livestreamen kan findes."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:330
msgid "Messages are written only during a livestream. When the creator is not live, the bot checks once more after 5 minutes and otherwise skips the message (as few YouTube calls as possible)."
msgstr "Beskeder skrives kun under en livestream. Er creatoren ikke live, tjekker botten én gang til efter 5 minutter og springer ellers beskeden over (så få YouTube-kald som muligt)."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:331
msgid "The day's YouTube quota is not used up (10,000 units; a message costs 20, a live check 1)."
msgstr "Dagens YouTube-kvote er ikke brugt op (10.000 enheder; en besked koster 20, et live-tjek 1)."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Admin/ChatbotAdminTab.php:334
msgid "YouTube shows no bot badge; creators can make the bot a moderator. While the Google app is in testing, at most 100 test users can log in and logins expire after 7 days: publish the app in the Google Cloud console (\"In production\") with the URLs from the tab \"YouTube terms\", and log the bot in again. Without Google's verification, Google shows a warning at login."
msgstr "YouTube viser intet bot-badge; creators kan gøre botten til moderator. Mens Google-appen er i test, kan højst 100 testbrugere logge ind, og logins udløber efter 7 dage: offentliggør appen i Google Cloud-konsollen (\"In production\") med URL'erne fra fanen \"YouTube-vilkår\", og log botten ind igen. Uden Googles verificering viser Google en advarsel ved login."

