msgstr "En produktmarkup kan kun sættes for et simpelt eller variabelt produkt; varianter bruger hovedproduktets markup."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:119
msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "Priser"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:120
msgid "The WooCommerce sale price is the final customer price and already includes the creator profit and VAT. Creator profit = sale price × markup %. Merch Dashboard never adds anything to the price and never changes WooCommerce prices."
msgstr "WooCommerce-salgsprisen er den endelige kundepris og indeholder allerede creator-profit og moms. Creator-profit = salgspris × markup %. Merch Dashboard lægger aldrig noget oven i prisen og ændrer aldrig WooCommerce-priser."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/CreatorPricingSection.php:121
msgid "For each order line, the profit is calculated from the amount the customer actually paid including VAT, with the markup and VAT status that applied when the order line was created."
msgstr "For hver ordrelinje beregnes profitten ud fra det beløb, kunden faktisk betalte inkl. moms, med den markup og momsstatus, der gjaldt, da ordrelinjen blev oprettet."

