#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:528
msgid "The stored history can only be deleted when the WooCommerce order is in the trash or deleted, e.g. a test order. Move the order to the trash in WooCommerce first."
msgstr "Den gemte historik kan kun slettes, når WooCommerce-ordren ligger i papirkurven eller er slettet, fx en testordre. Flyt først ordren til papirkurven i WooCommerce."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:532
msgid "Permanently deletes what Merch Dashboard has stored for this order: its ledger rows, cycle events, stored tax and profit snapshots. The order disappears from the creator's sales, statistics and profit. The WooCommerce order is not changed. If it is restored from the trash later, it is registered again without profit data. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Sletter permanent det, Merch Dashboard har gemt for denne ordre: ledger-rækker, cyklushændelser, gemt moms og profit-snapshots. Ordren forsvinder fra creatorens salg, statistik og profit. WooCommerce-ordren ændres ikke. Gendannes den senere fra papirkurven, registreres den igen uden profitdata. Det kan ikke fortrydes."

