msgstr "Intet blev slettet: ordrehistorikken kunne ikke slettes. Prøv igen senere."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:568
msgid "Open case – creator discount code"
msgstr "Åben sag – creator-rabatkode"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:569
msgid "Excluded – creator discount code"
msgstr "Udelukket – creator-rabatkode"

#. translators: 1: status, 2: creator name.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:579
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s (%2$s)"
msgstr "%1$s (%2$s)"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:604
msgid "Orders excluded by creator discount codes"
msgstr "Ordrer udelukket af creator-rabatkoder"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:605
msgid "When an order used a creator's own discount code, that creator's lines of the order count nowhere: not in sales, profit, payouts or new settlement documents. Other creators' lines of the same order count normally. The decision is made once and is permanent. An open case is a creator whose lines of the order were already settled; those settled rows and documents are not changed, and the case is not resolved automatically."
msgstr "Har en ordre brugt en creators egen rabatkode, tæller den creators linjer i ordren ingen steder: hverken i salg, fortjeneste, udbetalinger eller nye afregningsbilag. Andre creators' linjer i samme ordre tæller normalt. Afgørelsen træffes én gang og er varig. En åben sag er en creator, hvis linjer i ordren allerede var afregnet; de afregnede rækker og bilag ændres ikke, og sagen afgøres ikke automatisk."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:607
msgid "All excluded orders"
msgstr "Alle udelukkede ordrer"

#. translators: %s: number of open cases.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:610
#, php-format
msgid "Open cases (%s)"
msgstr "Åbne sager (%s)"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:618
msgid "No orders are excluded."
msgstr "Ingen ordrer er udelukket."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:624
msgid "Order created"
msgstr "Ordre oprettet"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:624
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:172
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutRecalculationsPage.php:212
msgid "Decided"
msgstr "Afgjort"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:635
msgid "The coupon deviated from the registration when the order was decided."
msgstr "Kuponen afveg fra registreringen, da ordren blev afgjort."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:673
msgid "This creator's lines of the order were already in a settlement document. Those rows and documents are not changed; the creator's other rows of the order do not count. The case is not resolved automatically."
msgstr "Denne creators linjer i ordren lå allerede i et afregningsbilag. De rækker og bilag ændres ikke; creatorens øvrige rækker i ordren tæller ikke. Sagen afgøres ikke automatisk."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:674
msgid "None of this creator's lines of the order count in sales, profit, payouts or new settlement documents, and no new ledger events are stored for them. Other creators' lines count normally."
msgstr "Ingen af denne creators linjer i ordren tæller i salg, fortjeneste, udbetalinger eller nye afregningsbilag, og der gemmes ingen nye ledger-hændelser for dem. Andre creators' linjer tæller normalt."

#. translators: 1: creator name, 2: discount code, 3: date.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:677
#, php-format
msgid "the order used the discount code of %1$s (%2$s); decided %3$s."
msgstr "ordren brugte rabatkoden fra %1$s (%2$s); afgjort %3$s."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:680
msgid "The coupon deviated from the registration when the order was decided (it was missing or had another ID). The creator's lines are excluded all the same."
msgstr "Kuponen afveg fra registreringen, da ordren blev afgjort (den manglede eller havde et andet ID). Creatorens linjer er udelukket alligevel."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:691
msgid "About the profit data"
msgstr "Om profitdata"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:694
msgid "Complete: every ledger row of the order has its profit snapshot and its stored tax, so the creator profit can be calculated (ADR-049)."
msgstr "Komplet: alle ordrens ledger-rækker har deres profit-snapshot og gemte moms, så creator-profitten kan beregnes (ADR-049)."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:695
msgid "Incomplete: some rows have the data, others do not. Unknown: no row has it. Missing history is never filled in, recalculated from current settings or shown as 0."
msgstr "Ufuldstændig: nogle rækker har data, andre ikke. Ukendt: ingen række har dem. Manglende historik udfyldes aldrig, genberegnes aldrig ud fra nuværende indstillinger og vises aldrig som 0."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:698
msgid "The sales ledger, profit snapshots and stored tax are append-only. The one exception: an administrator can delete the stored history of one order once the WooCommerce order is in the trash or deleted, e.g. a test order. That removes the order from the creator's sales and profit and is recorded in the audit log."
msgstr "Salgsledgeren, profit-snapshots og gemt moms er append-only. Den eneste undtagelse: en administrator kan slette den gemte historik for én ordre, når WooCommerce-ordren ligger i papirkurven eller er slettet, fx en testordre. Det fjerner ordren fra creatorens salg og profit og registreres i audit-loggen."

#. translators: 1: rows with known profit, 2: rows without the data.
