msgstr "Registrér som udbetalt"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:941
msgid "Transfer the amount yourself (bank or PayPal) first. Registering it here sends no money; it only records that the transfer has been made. The creator's balance is checked again, and a payout it no longer covers is refused for manual handling."
msgstr "Overfør først selv beløbet (bank eller PayPal). En registrering her sender ingen penge; den registrerer kun, at overførslen er foretaget. Creatorens saldo kontrolleres igen, og en udbetaling, den ikke længere dækker, afvises til manuel behandling."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:946
msgid "Reference (optional)"
msgstr "Reference (valgfri)"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:948
msgid "For example the transaction ID from the bank or PayPal. Never enter an account number, IBAN or e-mail address: the reference is kept with the payout history."
msgstr "Fx transaktions-ID'et fra banken eller PayPal. Skriv aldrig et kontonummer, en IBAN eller en e-mailadresse: referencen gemmes i udbetalingshistorikken."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:949
